// `smithy.rules#endpointTests`, aws-sdk-js-v3 054298b1520fc45a7017966674a5ac3aa6f32a04),
// copied one row per case: `region,fips,dualstack,globalEndpoint,endpoint,url,signingRegion`
// with `ERR,` as the expectation of the cases the rules reject.

